&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containers and orchestration (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of networking, security, and IAM in the cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in at least one scripting language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
