&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exposure to Angular or other modern frontend frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with Kubernetes or container orchestration platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and Gitlab workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Helm charts or infrastructure-as-code tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API gateways (Traefik or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to distributed systems concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with VS Code or modern development environments&lt;/li&gt;
