&lt;li&gt;Prioritize the backlog based on feedback from users and the product owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the test team to ensure new developments in the product meet the requirements defined by the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
