&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools used in agile development, including JIRA and Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create briefings and present to Senior Government officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great organizational skills at the individual and program levels (scheduling, resource management, etc..)&lt;/li&gt;
