&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and ensure high-quality and reusable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and debug issues in the application, including performance optimization and error handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide continuous maintenance, support, and enhancements in existing systems and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
