&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Two Six Technologies, we build, deploy, and implement innovative products that solve the world’s most complex challenges today. Through unrivaled collaboration and unwavering trust, we push the boundaries of what’s possible to empower our team and support our customers in building a safer global future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two Six Technologies is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team, focusing on developing and maintaining infrastructure that supports cutting-edge cybersecurity and national security research. This role emphasizes &lt;strong&gt;automation, process improvement, and test infrastructure development&lt;/strong&gt; for high-priority projects. You&#39;ll play a key role in ensuring the readiness and efficiency of systems supporting critical R&amp;amp;D initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not your standard corporate IT position, it requires a problem-solving mindset, adaptability to ambiguity, and a commitment to delivering innovative solutions. You will have the opportunity to work closely with diverse technical teams, expanding your expertise across hardware, software, and advanced system development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD System Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and enhance Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment systems to streamline development and testing pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate development, testing, and deployment processes using modern tools and techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain test environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop dashboards to provide real-time status updates on infrastructure availability, configuration, and usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with development, cybersecurity, and systems teams to integrate solutions and address challenges effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement automation opportunities to improve team workflows and reduce manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need (basic qualifications):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Top Secret/SCI clearance and polygraph.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience with DevOps or infrastructure automation, or an equivalent combination of education, certifications, and demonstrated experience in related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in scripting languages such as &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Bash&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Infrastructure-as-Code tools like &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Ansible&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in containerization technologies, including &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, for orchestration and microservices architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD tools, preferably &lt;strong&gt;GitLab&lt;/strong&gt; or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;virtualization platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., VMware, Proxmox, or Hyper-V).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with &lt;strong&gt;network engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, such as configuring switches and routers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Linux environments and command-line tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and troubleshooting skills across hardware and software domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work at the TST Office in Arlington, Virginia daily.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have (Preferred):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with OpenStack for building and managing private cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud) to design and manage secure, scalable infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in advanced scripting and automation using Python or similar languages to create robust tools and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with logging, monitoring, and observability tools, such as ELK Stack, Prometheus, or Grafana, to ensure system reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CompTIA Security+ or similar DoD 8570 Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing software as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Top Secret/SCI clearance and polygraph.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
