&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Locations are Englewood, CO or Herndon, VA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience architecting event-driven systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing Java and/or Go applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and deploying containerized microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using code repositories such as Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with resilient systems in multiple data centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux, Jira/Confluence, GitLab, GIT, RDBMS, messaging/queuing technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS cloud solutions, serverless frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience documenting code artifacts, JIRA tickets, and related processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build libraries for third parties to interact with and leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run to ground end-to-end issues, especially with multiple integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the design and development of new capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, or related discipline from an accredited college or university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keys for Success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 to 10+ years of Java/Go development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5+ years of Cloud platform development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 to 10+ years of unit testing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice If You Have Experience with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with satellite systems and operations such as mission management, planning and scheduling, or command and telemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SIGINT domain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing multi-threaded systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS Lambda and related technologies&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
