&lt;p id=&quot;gmail-p-rc_2c0f9cca1622825f-21&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail-citation-9 gmail-citation-10 gmail-citation-11 gmail-citation-12 gmail-citation-end-12&quot;&gt;The Strategic Account Executive coordinates the customer relationship and engages in and supports strategy—from executive engagement and opportunity shaping through capture, cont&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail-citation-9 gmail-citation-10 gmail-citation-11 gmail-citation-end-11&quot;&gt;ract award, delivery transition, and long-term account growth. Success requires disciplined execution of the sales process, strong customer intimacy, strate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail-citation-9 gmail-citation-10 gmail-citation-end-10&quot;&gt;gic thinking, and the ability to lead matrixed teams across Growth, Capability Units, Engineering, Product, Capture, Mar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail-citation-9 gmail-citation-end-9&quot;&gt;keting, and Program Delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;gmail-p-rc_2c0f9cca1622825f-21&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail-citation-9 gmail-citation-end-9&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid position with travel as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;gmail-p-rc_2c0f9cca1622825f-21&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-sources&quot; class=&quot;gmail-ng-tns-c2815270890-17 gmail-lm-enabled gmail-hide-from-message-actions gmail-ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Serve as the primary owner for assigned accounts, developing multi-year growth strategies, identifying whitespace opportunities across programs, and tracking program lifecycles and technology refresh opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build deep, trusted-advisor relationships across customer organizations (from operational users to flag officers, PEOs, and PMs) and conduct regular joint account business reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity Shaping:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage early in the customer lifecycle to identify emerging priorities, influence acquisition strategies, develop shaping campaigns, and position the company for sole-source or adjacent mission opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Execution &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Execute a repeatable sales process to identify, qualify, and close deals, owning annual bookings/revenue targets and driving cross-capability portfolio selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capture Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead capture planning and win-strategy development for strategic pursuits, including Black Hat sessions, competitive positioning, discriminators, pricing strategies, and executive gate reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
