&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage key performance indicators (KPIs), participate in weekly pipeline and quarterly account reviews, and drive opportunity prioritization and risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
