&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Two Six Technologies, we build, deploy, and implement innovative products that solve the world’s most complex challenges today. Through unrivaled collaboration and unwavering trust, we push the boundaries of what’s possible to empower our team and support our customers in building a safer global future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two Six Technologies is seeking a Software Engineering Summer Intern to research and develop next-generation technologies for mobile communications and networks. We are seeking candidates that have an interest in research as well as a commitment to developing solutions for the real world. You will join a small, supportive team that values cooperation and creative spirit.We are seeking several interns for this 12-week internship program, which will be conducted onsite in Arlington, VA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in research programs focused on advancing technology in the areas of resilient communications, next-generation networking, security, and privacy in mobile platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become intimately familiar with all aspects of what goes on inside of today&#39;s smartphones, including the hardware, kernel, drivers, firmware, framework, and apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop custom software solutions on mobile phones and other resource-constrained platforms, e.g., single-board computers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year or more of professional or academic software development experience in the C++ or Java programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with standard Linux software engineering tools, e.g. git, gcc, make&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible and able to obtain and maintain a government clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Android app development using Java or Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or modifying Android or other mobile operating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with network protocol development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Rust programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearance Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US Citizen with the ability to obtain and maintain required security clearance up to Top Secret&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
