&lt;p&gt;Two Six Technologies is actively seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Systems Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Digital Advantage Mission Ops team.&lt;/strong&gt; We are seeking several interns for this 12-week internship program, which will be conducted &lt;strong&gt;onsite &lt;/strong&gt;in Arlington, VA.&lt;/p&gt;
