&lt;li&gt;1+ year of professional or academic C and Python software development, Linux kernel familiarity and Knowledge of Networking fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with git and different Linux software development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US Citizenship is required due to the nature of our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work onsite at our Arlington, VA office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
