&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Linux internals (kernel modules, drivers, device enumeration, debugging below userspace)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity of PCIe system architecture (topology, addressing, peer-to-peer, virtualization, and passthrough).&lt;/li&gt;
